---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---
<PageLayout title="Privacy Policy" description={`How ${SITE.name} handles your data: files stay in your browser, and Google may use advertising cookies to show ads on this site.`} h1="Privacy policy" crumb="Privacy policy" updated="2026-10-04">
  {/* AUTHOR REVIEW: check this policy matches what you actually do, then keep the date current. This is general information, not legal advice. */}
  <p>
    This policy explains what information {SITE.name} ("we", "the site") collects and how it is used. By using the site
    you agree to this policy.
  </p>
  <h2>Your files stay in your browser</h2>
  <p>
    Our tools process photos, PDFs and text on your own device using JavaScript. Files you select are not uploaded to
    our servers, are not stored by us, and cannot be seen by us. Names you type into the seating plan, random picker and
    grade tools are also processed only in your browser. Closing or refreshing the page clears them.
  </p>
  <h2>Information we may collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Log data.</strong> Our hosting provider may record standard technical details such as IP address, browser type, pages requested and time of visit. This is used for security and to keep the site running.</li>
    <li><strong>Messages you send us.</strong> If you email us, we keep your message and address only to reply to you.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not ask you to create an account and we do not sell personal information.</p>
  <h2>Advertising and cookies</h2>
  <p>
    We may show advertisements provided by Google AdSense or other advertising partners. Third-party vendors, including
    Google, use cookies to serve ads based on your previous visits to this and other websites. Google's use of
    advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visit to this site and other sites
    on the internet.
  </p>
  <p>
    You can opt out of personalised advertising by visiting
    <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>. You can also opt out
    of some third-party vendors' use of cookies for personalised advertising at
    <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener noreferrer">aboutads.info</a>. To learn how Google uses
    data from sites that use its services, see
    <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener noreferrer">How Google uses information from sites or apps that use our services</a>.
  </p>
  <p>
    Most browsers let you block or delete cookies in their settings. The tools will keep working if you do this, although
    ads may become less relevant to you.
  </p>
  <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
  <p>The site may link to other websites. We are not responsible for their content or privacy practices.</p>
  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>The site is a general-audience educational site and is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>
  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top shows when it last changed.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy can be sent through the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
</PageLayout>
